@startuml AI Q&A with Hybrid RAG
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title AI Question & Answer Flow\n(Hybrid RAG: Documents + Task Statistics)

actor User as U
participant "AIController" as AC
participant "AIService" as AS
participant "GroupParticipantRepo" as GPR
participant "EmbeddingService\n(Gemini)" as ES
participant "VectorDBService\n(Qdrant)" as QD
participant "TaskRepository" as TR
participant "LLMService\n(Groq)" as LLM
database "PostgreSQL" as PG

== Step 1: User Ask Question ==

U -> AC: POST /api/ai/ask\n{groupId, question}
activate AC

AC -> AC: ValidateAndGetUserId()\nExtract userId from JWT

AC -> AS: AskQuestionAsync(userId, request)
activate AS

AS -> AS: Start Stopwatch\nTrack processing time

== Step 2: Validate Permissions ==

AS -> GPR: IsUserInGroupAsync(groupId, userId)
activate GPR
GPR -> PG: SELECT FROM GroupParticipants\nWHERE groupId AND userId
GPR <-- PG: true/false
AS <-- GPR: isMember
deactivate GPR

alt User không ph?i member
    AS -> AC: throw GroupPermissionDenied
    AC -> U: 403 Forbidden
end

== Step 3: Generate Query Embedding ==

AS -> ES: GenerateEmbeddingAsync(question)
activate ES

ES -> ES: POST https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\n/v1beta/models/text-embedding-004:embedContent\n{\n  "content": {"parts": [{"text": question}]},\n  "taskType": "RETRIEVAL_QUERY"\n}

note right of ES
**Gemini Embedding API**
Model: text-embedding-004
Output: 768 dimensions
Task: RETRIEVAL_QUERY
end note

ES -> ES: Parse JSON response\nExtract embedding vector

AS <-- ES: float[768] queryEmbedding
deactivate ES

== Step 4: Search Qdrant (Document Context) ==

AS -> QD: SearchVectorsAsync(queryEmbedding, topK=3, groupId)
activate QD

QD -> QD: POST /collections/studystudio_documents/points/search\n{\n  "vector": [float array],\n  "limit": 3,\n  "filter": {\n    "must": [{"key": "groupId", "match": {"value": groupId}}]\n  },\n  "with_payload": true\n}

note right of QD
**Vector Search**
Algorithm: Cosine similarity
Filter: ONLY documents in groupId
Return: Top 3 most relevant chunks
end note

QD -> QD: Search similar vectors\nCosine similarity

AS <-- QD: List<SearchResult>\n[{id, score, payload}, ...]
deactivate QD

== Step 5: Query Task Statistics ==

AS -> TR: GetGroupTaskStatisticsAsync(groupId)
activate TR

TR -> PG: SELECT FROM Tasks\nWHERE groupId AND !IsPendingDeleted
TR <-- PG: List<TaskItem>

TR -> TR: Calculate statistics:\n- Total tasks\n- Completed tasks (status contains "done")\n- Overdue tasks (dueDate < now)\n- Completion percentage\n- Nearest deadline\n- Risk flags

note right of TR
**Task Statistics**
- Count totals
- Filter by status
- Check deadlines
- Generate warnings
end note

AS <-- TR: TaskSummaryResponse\n{totalTasks, completed, overdue, ...}
deactivate TR

== Step 6: Build Context ==

AS -> AS: BuildContext(searchResults, taskSummary)

note right of AS
**Context Format:**

=== TÀI LI?U LIÊN QUAN ===

[Tài li?u 1] document.pdf
Ð? liên quan: 0.85
<chunk content>

[Tài li?u 2] notes.txt
Ð? liên quan: 0.78
<chunk content>

=== TH?NG KÊ CÔNG VI?C ===
T?ng s? tasks: 15
Ð? hoàn thành: 8/15 (53%)
Tasks quá h?n: 2
Deadline g?n nh?t: 15/03/2024

C?nh báo:
- ?? Có 2 task(s) quá h?n
end note

== Step 7: Call LLM (Groq) ==

AS -> LLM: GenerateAnswerAsync(systemPrompt, question, context)
activate LLM

LLM -> LLM: Build messages:\n[\n  {role: "system", content: SYSTEM_PROMPT},\n  {role: "user", content: question + context}\n]

LLM -> LLM: POST https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions\n{\n  "model": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",\n  "messages": messages,\n  "temperature": 0.7,\n  "max_tokens": 2000\n}

note right of LLM
**Groq LLM Parameters**
Model: llama-3.3-70b-versatile
Temperature: 0.7 (balanced)
Max Tokens: 2000
System Prompt: AI assistant rules
end note

LLM -> LLM: Parse response\nExtract answer text

AS <-- LLM: string answer
deactivate LLM

== Step 8: Build Response ==

AS -> AS: Stop Stopwatch\nprocessingTimeMs = stopwatch.ElapsedMilliseconds

AS -> AS: Map SearchResults to SourceDocuments:\n- documentId\n- chunkIndex\n- relevanceScore\n- preview (first 200 chars)

AS -> AS: Build AIAnswerResponse:\n- answer\n- sourceDocuments\n- taskSummary\n- processingTimeMs\n- generatedAt

AC <-- AS: AIAnswerResponse
deactivate AS

U <-- AC: 200 OK\n{\n  "answer": "...",\n  "sourceDocuments": [...],\n  "taskSummary": {...},\n  "processingTimeMs": 1245\n}
deactivate AC

== Frontend Display ==

U -> U: Display answer v?i\n- Source documents\n- Task statistics\n- Processing time

@enduml
